          "level": 1,
          "text": "P10-KERNEL-FIX — Kernel fix for `classifySessionQuorum` (Phase 10)",
          "anchor": "p10-kernel-fix-kernel-fix-for-classifysessionquorum-phase-10",
          "githubAnchor": "p10-kernel-fix-kernel-fix-for-classifysessionquorum-phase-10",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f99fd252776c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "1. Design Notes",
          "anchor": "1-design-notes",
          "githubAnchor": "1-design-notes",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0c1b8e885b68"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1.1 The bug, precisely",
          "anchor": "11-the-bug-precisely",
          "githubAnchor": "11-the-bug-precisely",
          "stableAnchor": "h-66b07c94da5d"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1.2 The naive fix, and why it is wrong — confirmed, not assumed",
          "anchor": "12-the-naive-fix-and-why-it-is-wrong-confirmed-not-assumed",
          "githubAnchor": "12-the-naive-fix-and-why-it-is-wrong-confirmed-not-assumed",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e7e35f7578a2"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1.3 The actual rule",
          "anchor": "13-the-actual-rule",
          "githubAnchor": "13-the-actual-rule",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f08e4bd369e5"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1.4 A third exclusion, found empirically while running the regression suite",
          "anchor": "14-a-third-exclusion-found-empirically-while-running-the-regression-suite",
          "githubAnchor": "14-a-third-exclusion-found-empirically-while-running-the-regression-suite",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1efb6043ef85"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1.5 Implementation",
          "anchor": "15-implementation",
          "githubAnchor": "15-implementation",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b25d56e51c37"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2. Proof Matrix",
          "anchor": "2-proof-matrix",
          "githubAnchor": "2-proof-matrix",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4b3beaab8432"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "3. Commands",
          "anchor": "3-commands",
          "githubAnchor": "3-commands",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c82e081c2c1d"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "4. GitNexus Impact-Analysis Gate (per project CLAUDE.md)",
          "anchor": "4-gitnexus-impact-analysis-gate-per-project-claudemd",
          "githubAnchor": "4-gitnexus-impact-analysis-gate-per-project-claudemd",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b415789706b7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "5. Gaps",
          "anchor": "5-gaps",
          "githubAnchor": "5-gaps",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ca5b624c75f5"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Summary",
          "anchor": "summary",
          "githubAnchor": "summary",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c5cf59e930d7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "6. Disposition (Coordinator, 2026-09-04)",
          "anchor": "6-disposition-coordinator-2026-09-04",
          "githubAnchor": "6-disposition-coordinator-2026-09-04",
          "stableAnchor": "h-29585f43d29e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "7. Fix Round 1",
          "anchor": "7-fix-round-1",
          "githubAnchor": "7-fix-round-1",
          "stableAnchor": "h-496518d6737b"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "7.1 HIGH-1 — resolution failures degrade to `definition = null`",
          "anchor": "71-high-1-resolution-failures-degrade-to-definition-null",
          "githubAnchor": "71-high-1-resolution-failures-degrade-to-definition-null",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f502c1075398"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "7.2 HIGH-2 — version drift is refused explicitly, on CLOSE only",
          "anchor": "72-high-2-version-drift-is-refused-explicitly-on-close-only",
          "githubAnchor": "72-high-2-version-drift-is-refused-explicitly-on-close-only",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8166c4a8250b"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "7.3 HIGH-3 — corrected the false \"byte-identical fallback\" claim",
          "anchor": "73-high-3-corrected-the-false-byte-identical-fallback-claim",
          "githubAnchor": "73-high-3-corrected-the-false-byte-identical-fallback-claim",
          "stableAnchor": "h-83d11e0bcf82"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "7.4 HIGH-4 — quorum/close coverage added for all 5 previously-dark protocols",
          "anchor": "74-high-4-quorumclose-coverage-added-for-all-5-previously-dark-protocols",
          "githubAnchor": "74-high-4-quorumclose-coverage-added-for-all-5-previously-dark-protocols",
          "stableAnchor": "h-cccb441d5056"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "7.5 MEDIUM-5 — aggregation exclusion keyed on the designated actor, not operation id alone",
          "anchor": "75-medium-5-aggregation-exclusion-keyed-on-the-designated-actor-not-operation-id-alone",
          "githubAnchor": "75-medium-5-aggregation-exclusion-keyed-on-the-designated-actor-not-operation-id-alone",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4780e301faf0"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "7.6 MEDIUM-6, LOW-8 — named as Gaps, not fixed",
          "anchor": "76-medium-6-low-8-named-as-gaps-not-fixed",
          "githubAnchor": "76-medium-6-low-8-named-as-gaps-not-fixed",
          "stableAnchor": "h-cc02873c8a6c"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "7.7 MEDIUM-7 — accepted as a Gap, not implemented",
          "anchor": "77-medium-7-accepted-as-a-gap-not-implemented",
          "githubAnchor": "77-medium-7-accepted-as-a-gap-not-implemented",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1130bb9f2f47"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "7.8 Full regression evidence (real runs, not narrated)",
          "anchor": "78-full-regression-evidence-real-runs-not-narrated",
          "githubAnchor": "78-full-regression-evidence-real-runs-not-narrated",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c9abdc6970c3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Summary (Fix Round 1)",
          "anchor": "summary-fix-round-1",
          "githubAnchor": "summary-fix-round-1",
          "stableAnchor": "h-80969699dd6e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "9. Disposition (Fix Round 2, Coordinator, 2026-09-04)",
          "anchor": "9-disposition-fix-round-2-coordinator-2026-09-04",
          "githubAnchor": "9-disposition-fix-round-2-coordinator-2026-09-04",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c7618eb021b9"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "10. Fix Round 2",
          "anchor": "10-fix-round-2",
          "githubAnchor": "10-fix-round-2",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1c63d6852db8"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "10.1 N1 + N2/NEW-HIGH-A — one unified resolution-failure/drift path, symmetric across READ and CLOSE",
          "anchor": "101-n1-n2new-high-a-one-unified-resolution-failuredrift-path-symmetric-across-read-and-close",
          "githubAnchor": "101-n1-n2new-high-a-one-unified-resolution-failuredrift-path-symmetric-across-read-and-close",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6bb1befba3e1"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "10.2 NEW-HIGH-B — the MEDIUM-5 regression test's fixture is now genuinely falsifiable",
          "anchor": "102-new-high-b-the-medium-5-regression-tests-fixture-is-now-genuinely-falsifiable",
          "githubAnchor": "102-new-high-b-the-medium-5-regression-tests-fixture-is-now-genuinely-falsifiable",
          "stableAnchor": "h-03e901606a04"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "10.3 N4/NEW-MEDIUM-C — the aggregation exclusion applies only when EXACTLY ONE actor binds `outputOperationRef`",
          "anchor": "103-n4new-medium-c-the-aggregation-exclusion-applies-only-when-exactly-one-actor-binds-outputoperationref",
          "githubAnchor": "103-n4new-medium-c-the-aggregation-exclusion-applies-only-when-exactly-one-actor-binds-outputoperationref",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f1f565783281"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "10.4 N3, NEW-LOW-D — named as Gaps, not fixed",
          "anchor": "104-n3-new-low-d-named-as-gaps-not-fixed",
          "githubAnchor": "104-n3-new-low-d-named-as-gaps-not-fixed",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9a801471ed1e"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "10.5 N5 — trivial test-count correction",
          "anchor": "105-n5-trivial-test-count-correction",
          "githubAnchor": "105-n5-trivial-test-count-correction",
          "stableAnchor": "h-35555c78fd11"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "10.6 Full regression evidence (real runs, not narrated)",
          "anchor": "106-full-regression-evidence-real-runs-not-narrated",
          "githubAnchor": "106-full-regression-evidence-real-runs-not-narrated",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c75b90e95bf6"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Summary (Fix Round 2)",
          "anchor": "summary-fix-round-2",
          "githubAnchor": "summary-fix-round-2",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ed260fd1f5bd"
        },
        {
